    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>The MC Works Explosion Full Contact EX843CTR is a lightweight, high-performance spinning rod designed for topwater casting.</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Built with a soft tip for easy pencil and stickbait manipulation, paired with a powerful progressive butt section.</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Engineered for high lift and heavy drag handling despite its slim, light blank profile, capable of handling fish over 10 kg.</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Specifications :<br /><span>Type:&nbsp;Spin&nbsp;<br />Length: 8’4”<br />Line:&nbsp;PE2/4<br />Casting max:&nbsp;gr 20/60<br />Drag max: 6kg<br />Grips: EVA<br /></span>Guides:Fuji Taitanium</p>",
